          text Thank you for your interest in contacting Wikipedia. Before proceeding, some important disclaimers:
          text Contributions are made by a large number of volunteers at their own discretion. Edits are neither the responsibility of the  (the organisation that hosts the site) nor of its staff.
          text Wikipedia has no central editorial board.
          link "Wikimedia Foundation" https://foundation.wikimedia.org/wiki/Home
          text Generally, the agent who responds to an email request will not make edits on your behalf.
          text Disagreements with content will not be resolved via email. Use the  to propose specific changes to an article.
          link "Edit Request Wizard" https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Edit_Request_Wizard
          text Although Wikipedia was co-founded by , he is not personally responsible for our content.
          link "Jimmy Wales" https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jimmy_Wales
          text If you have questions about the  of Wikipedia rather than a specific problem, the  page may help.
